	(text "Protection: R809 11.0 k on ISET -> I_LIM = 1.50 A (NEVER leave ISET open — the datasheet says an open pin damages the device). R810 10 k beats the internal 100 k pull-up on E/S: 3.3 x 10/110 = 0.30 V < 0.8 V = shut down until firmware raises TX_EN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 38.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0357b5b3-6709-57b1-8a8a-a6c5a0f34416")
	)
	(text "3.32 k"
