		(uuid "06b1cd28-b0e2-5172-98b7-e7ef8aa4ecc0")
	)
	(text "Single +VEXT 7-18 V; total supply <= 24 V, absolute max 26 V. D801 clamps the output to +VEXT_TX, the same post-bead node."
