	(text "D801 / D802 SS54 clamp the output to +VEXT and to GND; R813 4.7 R 1 W isolates it; R814 / C817 (10 R + 10 nF) is the datasheet snubber; C818 10 uF blocks the 9 V mid-rail out of the coil (Z = 0.18 R at 89 kHz). JP802 + R815/R816 = the -20 dB pad option."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
