	(text "Power stage: SINGLE supply +VEXT (7-18 V), V- = GND. E/S, VDIG and both flags are referenced to V-, so V- = GND lets 3.3 V logic drive them directly; on +-12 V every one of them would need an optocoupler (SBOS372E Fig. 38)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 31.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
