	(text "R802 / R803 200 R loads -> 0.636 V pp at IOUT, inside the 0.8 V output-compliance limit (datasheet pins 19/20). C807 20 pF C0G on IOUT prevents clock feedthrough. FSELECT tied to DGND (frequency selected by the FSEL control bit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 22.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
