	)
	(text "Gain: non-inverting, R807 6.49 k over R808 270 R -> G = 25.0 (15.9 V pp = +-7.95 V = 5.6 mA into the 1419 R coil = t90 417 us at 89.4 kHz). Alternative R808 stuffings: 1.00 k -> G 7.49 and 3.32 k -> G 2.95 for the >= 1 MHz settings."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 35 0)
