	)
	(text "Grounding (re-spec 8.1): the AD9834 AGND and DGND are tied together AT THE DEVICE and belong to the AGND pour; AVDD/DVDD come from +3V3 through FB801 (local rail +3V3D). The OPA564 and the coil return are on GND. C810 is the only signal crossing the two pours."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 47.8 0)
		(effects
