	)
	(text "Sequencing (SBOS372E Fig. 36): VDIG (+3V3, from USB) must come up BEFORE V+ (+VEXT, bench supply) — silkscreen note next to the external power input. PowerPAD pin 21 = V- = GND, pad DOWN on the ground pour with a via array (theta_JA 33 C/W)."
